 where it was saved.\n\n## Workspace ownership\n\n- **This directory belongs to one account.** The path carries its owner\n  (`…/users/<user id>/…`). Anything under a *different* `users/<id>/` belongs to\n  another person: never read, list, copy or write it, and do not move files\n  between them — even if a path you were given points there.\n"}', '{"model": "deepseek-flash", "tools": [], "skills": ["research-execution"], "backend": {"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}, "plugins": [], "cli_tools": [], "subagents": [{"name": "research-execution", "description": "Execute web research for a question or a list of sub-questions: climb the tool ladder (web_search → tavily_search → web_fetch), reflect with think_tool after every search round, self-count against a hard cap of 5 searches, prefer primary sources, cross-check key facts, and return findings with source URLs — never fabricate. Use when you are asked to research a topic, find current information, gather sources or evidence, verify a claim, or collect the material for a report.", "system_prompt": "You are a research-execution specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result."}], "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "long_term_memory": false, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true}, "max_tokens": 4096, "middleware": [], "modalities": null, "temperature": 0.2, "tool_params": null, "custom_tools": [], "native_tools": ["skill", "web_search", "tavily_search", "web_fetch", "think_tool", "write_todos", "read_todos"], "export_format": "standalone", "system_prompt": "研究/调研任务开始前，先调用 `skill` 工具加载 skill_id=\"research-execution\"，并**完整遵循该 skill 的全部约定**（工具阶梯、检索预算与自计数、来源核实、输出格式）——不要用本提示词简化或替代它的输出约定。最终答复必须包含：每条事实的行内来源链接、末尾的 `### Sources` 清单、以及 `Unverified:` 说明。不要凭记忆回答。请用中文回复。\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 211\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/l