the user asked for (Markdown, DOCX, CSV, HTML, …) and save it with a descriptive filename inside `generated/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\n\n## Agent docs\n\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n\n\n## CLAUDE.md (embedded)\n\n# smart-agent — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 73\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/agents/agent_73\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/users/1/agents/agent_73`\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n", "include_docker": false, "use_deepagents": true, "include_chat_ui": true, "interrupt_after": null, "interrupt_before": null, "reasoning_effort": "low", "use_local_sandbox": false, "skill_router_model": "deepseek-chat", "enable_compiled_subagents": true}', '[]', '[{"name": "data-analysis", "description": "Content-independent data analysis mechanics. Provides chart types, tool usage patterns, and edge case handling for CSV and SQL data. Pair with a dataset-specific .skill.md for column semantics and business context.", "type": "dictionary", "template_id": null, "model": null, "system_prompt": "You are a data-analysis specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result.", "tools": [], "middleware": [], "interrupt_on": {}, "skills": [], "response_format": null, "workflow_id": null, "workflow_config": null}, {"name": "web-search", "description": "Search the web for the latest news, current events, and recent information. Use when the user asks about today''s news, current events, breaking news, recent updates, latest developments, or any extern", "type": "dictionary", "template_id": null, "model": null, "system_prompt": "You are a web-search specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result.", "tools": [], "middleware": [], "interrupt_on": {}, "skills": [], "response_format": null, "workflow_id": null, "workflow_config": null}, {"name": "ticket-classifier", "description": "Classifies customer support tickets by priority, category, and sentiment", "type": "dictionary", "template_id": null, "model": null, "system_prompt": "You are a ticket-classifier specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result.", "tools": [], "middleware": [], "interrupt_on": {}, "skills": [], "response_format": null, "workflow_id": null, "workflow_config": null}]', '{"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}', '{"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}', '{}', 0, NULL, '1.0.0', FALSE, FALSE, '2026-06-20 09:59:56.326435+00:00', '2026-11-10 12:06:17.498098+00:00', 1
